      "label": "Casual Approach to Policy",
      "description": "The meme's humor relies on the contrast between formal policy-making and a casual, almost dismissive tone ('damn girl'). This requires understanding of how public figures are often portrayed in media and how their tone can be used to mock or trivialize serious issues, particularly those related to gender or women's rights.",
